# Union artifact allowlist for the three release environments. Docker verifies
# every download against this hash lock, then resolves fresh Memory, Model, and
# init venvs from the offline wheelhouse so long-lived images do not inherit
# one another's optional distributions.
# Compile with:
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --allow-unsafe requirements-runtime.in
